        527.4400024414062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "adolescents (aged 10–19 years). Based on the available information in the studies the median age of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.392333984375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "patients in the three studies using the intervention regimen were: 35 months (range: 2 months–14",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.5885009765625,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "years), 28 months (range: 2 months–15 years) and 30 months (5–82 months). In the studies using the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991546630859375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3947143554688,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "comparator regimen, the age structure reported in two of the three studies was: <18 years and 3.3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3904418945312,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "years (range: 1–16 years). This recommendation therefore applies to both adolescents and children.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        154.91860961914062,
        527.5486450195312,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "Other subgroup analyses:  Several subgroup analyses were pre-planned by the systematic reviewers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 10.9844388961792,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.4279174804688,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "(including subgroup analyses by: age group, for patients with DR-TB (including isoniazid-resistant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.4201049804688,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "TB), for patients who were microbiologically confirmed versus those clinically diagnosed, by Medical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.4102783203125,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "Research Council stage at diagnosis, and for patients with complications including tuberculoma and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        480.5527648925781,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "hydrocephalus). However, these analyses could not be conducted due to insufficient data.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.6879425048828,
        337.8164978027344,
        256.56793212890625
      ],
      "text": "5.2.3. Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        262.77178955078125,
        527.4343872070312,
        277.2148132324219
      ],
      "text": "One key implementation consideration is the administration of the intervention regimen with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.971923828125,
        527.5940551757812,
        290.4149475097656
      ],
      "text": "correct dosages of the included medicines, using currently available child-friendly formulations,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        289.17193603515625,
        527.4133911132812,
        303.6149597167969
      ],
      "text": "including FDC formulations when possible. The regimen includes isoniazid, rifampicin, pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        302.371826171875,
        265.41217041015625,
        316.8148498535156
      ],
      "text": "and ethionamide, and is dosed as follows:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.0758056640625,
        78.23609924316406,
        338.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        324.0758056640625,
        303.4161376953125,
        338.5188293457031
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid: 20 mg per kg, maximum 400 mg daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.27581787109375,
        78.23609924316406,
        351.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        337.27581787109375,
        310.7091979980469,
        351.7188415527344
      ],
      "text": "Rifampicin: 20 mg per kg, maximum 600 mg daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.4757995605469,
        78.23609924316406,
        364.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        350.4757995605469,
        330.7842102050781,
        364.9188232421875
      ],
      "text": "Pyrazinamide: 40 mg per kg, maximum 2000 mg daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.6758117675781,
        78.23609924316406,
        378.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        363.6758117675781,
        320.80718994140625,
        378.11883544921875
      ],
      "text": "Ethionamide: 20 mg per kg, maximum 750 mg daily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.37969970703125,
        527.433349609375,
        399.8227233886719
      ],
      "text": "Historically, the regimen was dosed using a child-friendly FDC (dispersible tablet) of isoniazid and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.5797119140625,
        527.5938110351562,
        413.0227355957031
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin (60 mg/60 mg) with pyrazinamide and ethionamide added as single medicines. This 60/60",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990896224975586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.7796936035156,
        527.4443969726562,
        426.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "mg FDC has limited availability globally, while a 50/75 mg isoniazid/rifampicin dispersible tablet is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.9797058105469,
        527.4443969726562,
        439.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "widely available through the Stop TB Partnership Global Drug Facility in over 100 countries (at the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.1797180175781,
        527.4420166015625,
        452.62274169921875
      ],
      "text": "time of the GDG meeting). Using this formulation, rifampicin is dosed at slightly higher mg per kg",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.37969970703125,
        527.3870849609375,
        465.8227233886719
      ],
      "text": "doses as the drug ratio between isoniazid and rifampicin is 1:1.5 in the formulation. Higher doses of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.5797119140625,
        527.4423217773438,
        479.0227355957031
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin are being used in several other trials including the SURE trial, TBM Kids and OptiRif Kids.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.7796936035156,
        527.3914794921875,
        492.22271728515625
      ],
      "text": "Results from the SURE trial and TBM Kids are expected in the coming years while the results from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.18572998046875,
        527.3971557617188,
        505.4227294921875
      ],
      "text": "(74) the OptiRif Kids trial   were published after the GDG meeting. The dosing of the shorter intensive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.1796875,
        527.4540405273438,
        518.6226806640625
      ],
      "text": "regimen was the subject of an expert consultation convened by the WHO after the GDG meeting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.3796997070312,
        463.44964599609375,
        531.8226928710938
      ],
      "text": "and information on dosing for this regimen is included in the Operational Handbook.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.0836181640625,
        527.31640625,
        553.526611328125
      ],
      "text": "A dispersible paediatric formulation of ethionamide (125 mg) has been available from the Stop",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.28369140625,
        527.5640869140625,
        566.7266845703125
      ],
      "text": "TB Partnership GDF since March 2018. Although orders for ethionamide are received from high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.4837036132812,
        527.587158203125,
        579.9266967773438
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB burden countries consistently (this formulation was supplied by GDF to 41 countries between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971814155578613,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.68359375,
        527.4222412109375,
        593.1265869140625
      ],
      "text": "2019 and 2021 at the time of the GDG meeting), the GDG members discussed that the paediatric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.8837280273438,
        527.589599609375,
        606.3267211914062
      ],
      "text": "formulation of ethionamide may not be available in all countries or health care levels where it is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.083740234375,
        527.5597534179688,
        619.5267333984375
      ],
      "text": "needed. Ethionamide is a component of the shorter all-oral bedaquiline-containing regimens to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.2835693359375,
        527.3935546875,
        632.7265625
      ],
      "text": "treat MDR/RR-TB; however, at the time that the GDG meeting was held (May-June 2021) the shorter",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.483642578125,
        393.0358581542969,
        645.9266357421875
      ],
      "text": "regimen was only recommended for children aged 6 years and above.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.1876220703125,
        527.4168701171875,
        667.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG members also noted that this regimen should ideally be used in children with TBM that is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.3875732421875,
        527.4201049804688,
        680.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "bacteriologically confirmed as drug susceptible. However, it can also be used for children who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.5875854492188,
        527.385986328125,
        694.0305786132812
      ],
      "text": "clinically diagnosed, but there should be no suspicion of DR-TB, such as in children or adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.78759765625,
        527.3817749023438,
        707.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "who have a history of contact with a patient with confirmed DR-TB (including isoniazid resistance,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.9876098632812,
        527.3194580078125,
        720.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin resistance or multi-drug resistance). In countries or areas with a high background prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.954004287719727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.1876220703125,
        527.1749267578125,
        733.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "of DR-TB and where ethionamide is in use to treat DR-TB, programmes and clinicians need to consider",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.961934089660645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.3875732421875,
        527.4256591796875,
        746.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "the risks and benefits of using this regimen. The current recommendation for the diagnosis of TBM is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.5875854492188,
        527.4047241210938,
        760.0305786132812
      ],
      "text": "that in adults or children with signs and symptoms of TBM, Xpert MTB/RIF or Xpert Ultra should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        758.78759765625,
        527.3915405273438,
        773.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "used in cerebrospinal fluid as the initial diagnostic test rather than smear microscopy/culture (strong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "40 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
